&lt;p&gt;Tines has been supporting IT and security teams from a diverse range of customers, including Canva, Reddit, SAP, Coinbase, Mars, Fin (Intercom), and McKesson.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tines 3B, launched in 2026, is the next generation of Tines – a single, secure environment for every team’s apps, agents and automations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an integrator across the entire tech stack, Tines is vendor-agnostic integrating with any API-enabled service. This flexibility enables our customers to achieve their highest-priority goals faster. Tines has security woven into its DNA, and our platform is secure and private by design.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tines, we&#39;re driven by our values of Simplicity, Speed, and Soundness. We&#39;re committed to delivering exceptional customer experiences while fostering a company culture that nurtures individual curiosity, growth, and integrity. We’re excited about what’s next, and we’re looking for others to join us on our journey.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a 12 month fixed term contract position.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Dublin / Greater Dublin. Proximity to our Dublin city centre offices in D2.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a highly organised, resourceful, and proactive Executive Assistant to provide high-level administrative and operational support to our CEO &amp;amp; COO executives. This role requires exceptional judgment, the ability to manage sensitive information, and the agility to pivot quickly in a high-growth environment. The right candidate will be a strategic partner helping to anticipate needs, streamline operations, and ensure our executive leaders can focus on driving growth and operational excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee CEO and COO level engagements, calendar management, and complex travel coordination.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Board &amp;amp; Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage end to end logistics, agenda planning, and material preparation for Board meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross Functional Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Juggle and prioritise multiple streams of work originating from various internal teams to keep the CEO and COO office running smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Team Rhythm:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the cadence, scheduling, and operational rigour of all Executive Leadership Team meetings. Drive agenda planning, track action items, and ensure accountability across the leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Event Coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide administrative and logistical support for key company events and leadership gatherings across.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring with you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfortable taking ownership of tasks and working with a high degree of independence, while knowing when to check in and collaborate. Someone who can look around corners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrives in a dynamic environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Not everything comes with a playbook. Is able to apply good judgment and move forward confidently when the path isn&#39;t fully mapped out.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Resilience:&lt;/strong&gt; Experienced in dynamic, evolving environments where flexibility and resilience are part of everyday work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proven EA Track Record:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience supporting C-suite executives, with strong organisational, coordination and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tool stack: Proficiency in a digital workplace and collaboration platforms&lt;/strong&gt; that includes Slack, Notion, Google Suite and Navan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-SW1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Tines, we’re all about trying new things and taking the leap. If you’re second-guessing your application, we hope you’ll trust your gut and take the leap too! Applying for a new job isn’t always easy, especially if you’re thinking of a&amp;nbsp;career pivot&amp;nbsp;– but we’re big believers in learning and growth here at Tines, so you’ve nothing to worry about. A variety of experience, perspectives, and voices makes us&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.tines.com/blog/inside-tines&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.tines.com/blog/lessons-learned-from-graduate-software-engineer&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;the company we are&lt;/a&gt;. We’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
