&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Work closely with Sales Leadership to develop repeatable strategies for new logo acquisition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Deliver feedback to product and go-to-market teams on suggestions from customers and prospects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Embody our core values of speed, simplicity and soundness in your daily work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
