&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Proven track record of sales success with enterprise customers in the Bay Area region&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Experience selling a technical SaaS solution to technical stakeholders - CISO, CIO, CTO, Head of Engineering, DevOps, IT etc&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Ability to prospect for outbound leads and build customer demand and at the same time nurture and develop inbound lead flow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
