&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Experience in building fresh territories / geo patches from scratch and generating customer demand and opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
