&lt;p&gt;Tines is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Partner Solutions Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our pre-sales team, who are crucial to our growth and winning customers. You will work with our Channel Partner team to evangelize Tines&#39; SaaS solutions and educate existing and potential Partners on the business value that their customers can gain with intelligent workflows. You will use your product and technical knowledge to build enablement programs for our partners so that they can articulate the value of Tines and its approach to automation and integration. You will understand customers’ business pains and the outcomes they want to achieve and will guide the partners to show how Tines can help their customers realize those outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
