&lt;li&gt;Support the greater Solutions Engineering team in developing metrics and refining SE operations into best practices that are shared across all SE teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities you will assume:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic thought leadership by driving the strategic direction for Solutions Engineering within North America, aligning with overall business goals and specifically with the strategy around Partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and provide guidance to other Solutions Engineers, fostering professional growth and skill development within the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Tines at industry events, conferences, and webinars, showcasing the value of our solutions and establishing Tines as a thought leader in automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with product management, marketing, and engineering teams to influence product roadmap and strategy based on market and customer insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior advocate for key partners, ensuring their needs are met and their feedback is incorporated into product development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and drive initiatives that enhance the overall effectiveness and efficiency of the sales engineering function, including process improvements and new tool adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring with you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in a pre-sales / sales engineering or technology delivery at a SaaS company with emphasis on partner engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical background and experience working with APIs and a curiosity to learn new cloud technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of AI-Assisted development tools (Claude Code, Cursor, Codex, GitHub Copilot, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security and/or IT industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public Sector industry experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills and experience with uncovering customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with delivering compelling demos to customers and winning technical evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating with business and technical audiences to establish trust and influence key decision makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A love for learning, openness to giving and receiving feedback, and a passion for making clients successful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management skills and ability to deliver customer solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to craft actionable insights from complex data&lt;/li&gt;
